  "releaseNotes": "DarkIoStatusTable now embeds the live input LED/output switch inside the Address cell and uses four columns: Address, ID, Name, Index. Adds per-column text alignment and opt-in double-click editing with inline Save/Cancel, Enter/Escape shortcuts, validation through CellEditCommitted, and isolated live updates so only the active edit cell is frozen. Legacy StatusColumnWidth, StateColumnWidth, and StatusHeaderText remain as compatibility properties.",
